+# Official Accounting artifact versioned-owner connection
+
+Private integration evidence only. Production admission remains false. This is
+not proof of whole-platform update, coherent recovery, or SQL routing admission.
+
+`retainOfficialReportArtifact` accepts an optional genuine
+`files: VersionedFileRootScope`. The root must match the existing report root
+before any render, frozen read, or hash callback. New PDF/XLSX bytes publish to
+immutable retained storage before `recordHash`; frozen reads use the same owner.
+The existing transaction lock and exact frozen report meaning remain the
+caller's responsibility. No startup selector or environment activation was
+added, and omitted `files` preserves the existing legacy writer.
+
+The only tolerated versioned publication refusal is the owner's settled
+`FILE_VERSION_ALREADY_EXISTS`; the exact retained content must still match its
+content-addressed name. Unknown publication failures never fall back to raw
+filesystem writes. SQL callback failure intentionally retains the file/version
+for recovery and a later exact retry, without pretending the SQL transaction
+committed or automatically deleting its bytes.
+
+## Native evidence
+
+Runner: `node scripts/run-accounting-versioned-artifact-local.mjs`.
+It uses only the existing `sabalanerp-local` backend-candidate, checks Compose
+before every Docker action, and proves the original work owner drained in each
+test. No database or additional Docker stack is created. The SQL callback is the
+real module's public owner port; this fixture does not claim a live SQL commit.
+Private diagnostic directories and immutable evidence are retained.
+
